hadiths[75]{hadithnumber,text}:
"652","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab Ramazan ka mahina dakhil hota hai to aasman ke darwaze khol diye jate hain, Jahannam ke darwaze band kar diye jate hain aur shaitanon ko zanjeeron mein jakad diya jata hai."
"653","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ramazan ka zikr farmaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Roza na rakho yahan tak ke chaand dekho, aur iftar na karo yahan tak ke use dekho. Phir agar tum par badal chha jaye to us ka andaza karo."
"654","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mahina aise aur aise aur aise hai, matlab tees. Phir farmaya: Aur aise aur aise aur aise hai, matlab untees. Ek martaba tees kehte, ek martaba untees."
"655","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak hum anpadh ummat hain, na likhte hain na hisab karte hain. Mahina aise aur aise hai, matlab ek martaba untees aur ek martaba tees."
"656","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya, ya kaha: Abu al-Qasim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Usے dekh kar roza rakho aur usے dekh kar iftar karo. Phir agar tum par badal chha jaye to Sha'ban ki ginti tees poori karo."
"657","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi Ramazan se ek ya do din ke roze se aage na badhe, magar ye ke wo shakhs ho jo apna roza rakhta ho, to use chahiye ke wo din roza rakhe."
"658","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne qasam khayi ke Aap apne kuchh ghar walon ke paas ek mahina nahi jayenge. Phir jab untees din guzar gaye to Aap subah ya shaam un ke paas tashreef laye. To Aap se arz kiya gaya: Ya Nabiullah! Aap ne qasam khayi thi ke Aap un ke paas ek mahina nahi jayenge. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak mahina untees din ka hota hai."
"659","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Do mahine kam nahi hote, Eid ke do mahine: Ramazan aur Dhu al-Hijja."
"660","[AI-translation] Hazrat Adi bin Hatim (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab ye nazil hui [yahan tak ke tumhare liye safed dhaga siyah dhage se wazeh ho jaye] to main ne siyah rassi aur safed rassi ki taraf tawajjah ki aur unhe apne takiye ke neeche rakha. Phir main raat mein dekhta raha lekin mujhe wazeh na hua. Phir main subah Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se is ka zikr kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye to raat ki siyahi aur din ki safedi hai."
"661","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ye nazil hui [aur khayiye aur pijiye yahan tak ke tumhare liye safed dhaga siyah dhage se wazeh ho jaye] aur Fajr se nazil na hua tha. Phir jab log roza rakhna chahte to un mein se ek apne paon mein safed dhaga aur siyah dhaga bandhta. Aur khata rehta yahan tak ke un dono ka dekhna us ke liye wazeh ho jata. Phir Allah ne is ke baad Fajr se nazil farmaya. Phir unhon ne jana ke Ye to raat aur din ko kehta hai."
"662","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Bilal raat mein azan kehta hai. To khayiye aur pijiye yahan tak ke Ibn Umm Maktum elan kare."
"663","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Bilal raat mein azan kehte they. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Khayiye aur pijiye yahan tak ke Ibn Umm Maktum azan kahe. Kyunke wo azan nahi kehta yahan tak ke Fajr tulu ho jaye."
"664","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi ko, ya tum mein se ek ko Bilal ki azan sahri se na roke. Kyunke wo raat mein azan kehta hai, ya elan karta hai, taake tumhara qayam karne wala laute aur tumhara sone wala bedar ho. Aur usے ye nahi kehna ke Fajr ya Subah. Aur Aap ne apni ungliyon se kaha aur unhe upar uthaya aur neeche jhukaya, yahan tak ke Aap ne aise kaha."
"665","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Sahri karo, kyunke sahri mein barkat hai."
"666","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Thabit se Anas ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Zaid bin Thabit ne unhe bayan kiya ke unhon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath sahri ki, phir namaz ke liye khade hue. Main ne arz kiya: Un dono ke darmiyan kitna tha? Unhon ne kaha: Pachaas ya saath ke qadar, matlab ayat."
"667","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Log bhalayi mein rahenge jab tak iftar mein jaldi karenge."
"668","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab raat yahan se aaye, din yahan se peeth phere aur suraj ghuroob ho jaye to rozedar ne iftar kar liya."
"669","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abi Aufa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath safar mein they. To Aap ne ek shakhs se farmaya: Utro aur mere liye sattu ghoolo. Us ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Suraj hai. Aap ne farmaya: Utro aur mere liye ghoolo. Us ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Suraj hai. Aap ne farmaya: Utro aur mere liye ghoolo. Phir wo utra aur Aap ke liye ghoola. Phir Aap ne piya. Phir Aap ne apne hath se yahan ishara farmaya. Phir farmaya: Jab tum raat ko yahan se aate dekho to rozedar ne iftar kar liya."
"670","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne wisal se mana farmaya. Unhon ne arz kiya: Beshak tum wisal karte ho. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main tumhare jaisa nahi hun. Beshak mujhe khilaya aur pilaya jata hai."
"671","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne roze mein wisal se mana farmaya. Phir Aap se Musalmanon mein se ek shakhs ne kaha: Beshak tum wisal karte ho Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Aur tum mein se kaun mere jaisa hai? Beshak main raat guzarta hun jabke mera Rab mujhe khilata aur pilata hai. Phir jab unhon ne wisal se rukne se inkar kiya to Aap ne un se ek din, phir ek din wisal kiya. Phir unhon ne chaand dekha. To Aap ne farmaya: Agar aur der hota to main tumhe zyada karta, unhe saza ke taur par jab unhon ne rukne se inkar kiya."
"672","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Wisal se bacho, do martaba. Arz kiya gaya: Beshak tum wisal karte ho. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main raat guzarta hun jabke mera Rab mujhe khilata aur pilata hai. Phir amal mein se jitni taqat rakho karo."
"673","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mahine ke aakhir mein wisal kiya, aur logon mein se kuchh ne wisal kiya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khabar pahunchi. To Aap ne farmaya: Agar mahina mere liye lamba kiya jata to main wisal karta, aisa wisal jo gehrayi mein jane walon ki gehrayi chhor de. Beshak main tumhare jaisa nahi hun. Beshak main din guzarta hun jabke mera Rab mujhe khilata aur pilata hai."
"674","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne wisal se mana farmaya, un par rehem farmate hue. Phir unhon ne arz kiya: Beshak tum wisal karte ho. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main tumhari haalat jaisa nahi hun. Beshak mera Rab mujhe khilata aur pilata hai."
"675","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apni kuchh biwiyon ko bosa dete jabke Aap rozedar hote. Phir wo hansein."
"676","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bosa dete aur milte jabke Aap rozedar hote. Aur Aap tum mein apni khwahish par sab se zyada قابو rakhne wale they."
"677","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha aur Umm Salama se Abu Bakr bin Abd al-Rahman bin al-Harith bin Hisham ke hawale se riwayat hai ke un ke walid Abd al-Rahman ne Marwan ko khabar di ke Aisha aur Umm Salama ne unhe khabar di ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Fajr pati jabke Wo apne ghar walon se junbi hote. Phir ghusl farmate aur roza rakhte. Phir Marwan ne Abd al-Rahman bin al-Harith se kaha: Allah ki qasam khata hun ke tum Abu Hurairah ko is se khabar doge, jabke Marwan us din Madina par tha. Phir Abu Bakr ne kaha: Phir Abd al-Rahman ne isے na-pasand kiya. Phir hamare liye muqaddar hua ke hum Dhu al-Hulaifa mein jama hue, jabke Abu Hurairah ki wahan zameen thi. Phir Abd al-Rahman ne Abu Hurairah se kaha: Beshak main tumhe ek mamla batane wala hun. Aur agar Marwan ne mujh par us mein qasam na di hoti to main tumhe na batata. Phir unhon ne Aisha aur Umm Salama ka qaul zikr kiya. To unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Fadl bin Abbas ne aise hi bayan kiya, aur wo zyada jante hain."
"678","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Beshak doosra apni biwi se Ramazan mein mila. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum pate ho jo tum gardan aazad karo? Us ne arz kiya: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum taqat rakhte ho ke do mahine musalsal roze rakho? Us ne arz kiya: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum pate ho jo tum saath miskeenon ko khilao? Us ne arz kiya: Nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas khajooron ka tokra laya gaya, jo tokri hai. Unhon ne kaha: Is se apni taraf se khilao. Us ne arz kiya: Hum se zyada mohtaj par? Dono pathrile kinaron ke darmiyan hum se zyada mohtaj ghar wale nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir use apne ghar walon ko khilao."
"679","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs masjid mein Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Main jal gaya. Aap ne farmaya: Wo kis wajah se? Us ne arz kiya: Main Ramazan mein apni biwi se mila. Aap ne us se farmaya: Sadqa karo. Us ne arz kiya: Mere paas koi cheez nahi. Phir wo baitha. Aur Aap ke paas ek insan aaya jo gadha hank raha tha, us ke sath khana tha [Abd al-Rahman ne kaha, hadith ke ek rawi: Main nahi janta wo kya tha] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Jalne wala kahan hai? Us ne arz kiya: Main hun. Aap ne farmaya: Ye lo aur isے sadqa karo. Us ne arz kiya: Mujh se zyada mohtaj par? Mere ghar walon ke paas khana nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir use khayiye."
"680","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Ramazan mein Makkah ki taraf nikle. Phir roza rakha yahan tak ke Kadid pahunche to iftar farmaya. Phir logon ne iftar kiya."
"681","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) safar mein they. Phir Aap ne bheed dekhi aur ek shakhs jis par saya kiya gaya tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye kya hai? Unhon ne arz kiya: Rozedar hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Safar mein roza neki mein se nahi hai."
"682","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath safar karte. Phir rozedar iftar karne wale par aib na lagata, na iftar karne wala rozedar par."
"683","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath they, hum mein sab se zyada saya wala jo apni chadar se saya leta. Aur rahe jinhon ne roza rakha unhon ne kuchh kaam na kiya. Aur rahe jinhon ne iftar kiya unhon ne sawariyan bhejein, mehnat ki aur kaam kiya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Iftar karne wale aaj ajr lekar gaye."
"684","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Hamza bin Amr al-Aslami ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se arz kiya: Kya main safar mein roza rakhun? Jabke wo kasrat se roza rakhte they. To Aap ne farmaya: Agar chaho to roza rakho, agar chaho to iftar karo."
"685","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu al-Darda (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Aap ke kuchh safaron mein nikle, garm din mein, yahan tak ke aadmi garmi ki sakhti se apna hath apne sar par rakhta. Aur hum mein koi rozedar na tha, siwaye jo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Ibn Rawaha they."
"686","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm al-Fadl bint al-Harith (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke logon ne un ke paas Arafa ke din Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke roze mein ikhtilaf kiya. Phir un mein se kuchh ne kaha: Wo rozedar hain. Aur un mein se kuchh ne kaha: Wo rozedar nahi hain. Phir unhon ne Aap ki taraf doodh ka pyala bheja jabke Wo apne oont par thehre they. Phir Aap ne piya."
"687","[AI-translation] Hazrat Maimuna (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke logon ne Arafa ke din Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke roze mein shak kiya. Phir unhon ne Aap ki taraf doodh ka bartan bheja jabke Wo mauqif mein thehre they. Phir Aap ne us mein se piya jabke log dekh rahe they."
"688","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Quraish jahiliyat mein Ashura ka roza rakhte they. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ke roze ka hukm farmaya yahan tak ke Ramazan farz hua. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo chahe use roza rakhe aur jo chahe iftar kare."
"689","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ashura ko jahiliyat wale roza rakhte they. Phir jab Ramazan nazil hua to Aap ne farmaya: Jo chahe use roza rakhe aur jo chahe na rakhe."
"690","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Ash'ath un ke paas dakhil hue jabke wo kha rahe they. To unhon ne kaha: Aaj Ashura hai. To unhon ne kaha: Us ka roza rakha jata tha Ramazan ke nazil hone se pehle. Phir jab Ramazan nazil hua to chhor diya gaya. Phir qareeb aao aur khayiye."
"691","[AI-translation] Hazrat Muawiya bin Abi Sufyan se Humaid bin Abd al-Rahman ke hawale se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Muawiya bin Abi Sufyan ko Ashura ke din, jis saal unhon ne hajj kiya, mimbar par kehte suna: Ae Madina walo! Tumhare ulama kahan hain? Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Ye Ashura ka din hai. Aur tum par us ka roza farz nahi kiya gaya. Aur main rozedar hun. Phir jo chahe roza rakhe aur jo chahe iftar kare."
"692","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Madina tashreef laye aur Yahood ko Ashura ka roza rakhte dekha. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ye nek din hai. Ye wo din hai jis mein Allah ne Bani Israil ko un ke dushman se najaat di. Phir Musa ne use roza rakha. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main Musa ka tum se zyada haq-dar hun. Phir Aap ne use roza rakha aur us ke roze ka hukm farmaya."
"693","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ashura ka din Yahood Eid mante they. Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Phir tum use roza rakho."
"694","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kisi din ka roza talash karte nahi dekha jise Aap ne us ke siwa par fazilat di ho, magar is din, Ashura ke din. Aur is mahine, matlab Ramazan ke mahine."
"695","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salama bin al-Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ashura ke din logon mein elan karne ke liye ek shakhs ko bheja: Beshak jis ne khaya wo poora kare ya roza rakhe, aur jis ne na khaya wo na khaye."
"696","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rubayyi bint Muawwidh (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ashura ki subah Ansar ki bastiyon ki taraf bheja: Jo iftar karke subah kare wo apne din ka baqi poora kare, aur jo roza rakh kar subah kare wo roza rakhe. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum is ke baad use roza rakhte, aur apne bachchon ko roza rakhwate. Aur un ke liye oon ke khilone banate. Phir jab un mein se koi khane par rota to hum use wo dete yahan tak ke iftar ka waqt ho jata."
"697","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ye do din hain jin ke roze se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mana farmaya: Tumhare roze se iftar ka din, aur doosra din jis mein tum apni qurbaniyon mein se khate ho."
"698","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Do dinon mein roza nahi: Fitr aur Adha mein."
"699","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar se Ziyad bin Jubair ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Ibn Umar ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Ek shakhs ne ek din roza rakhne ki nazr mani. Unhon ne kaha: Mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: Peer ka, aur wo Eid ke din muwafiq hua. To Ibn Umar ne kaha: Allah ne nazr poori karne ka hukm diya hai, aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne is din ke roze se mana farmaya hai."
"700","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir se Muhammad bin Abbad ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se poochha: Kya Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Juma ke din ke roze se mana farmaya? Unhon ne kaha: Haan."
"701","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Tum mein se koi Juma ke din roza na rakhe magar us se pehle ya baad ka din."
"702","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salama (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab ye nazil hui [aur jo use bardasht karte hain un par fidya miskeen ka khana hai] to jo chahta iftar karta aur fidya deta, yahan tak ke us ke baad wali ayat nazil hui aur use mansookh kar diya."
"703","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujh par Ramazan ka roza hota to main use Sha'ban mein hi qaza kar sakti."
"704","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo mar jaye jabke us par roza ho to us ka wali us ki taraf se roza rakhe."
"705","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak meri walida faut ho gayi hain jabke un par mahine ka roza hai. To kya main un ki taraf se qaza karun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Allah ka qarz qaza kiye jane ka zyada haq-dar hai."
"706","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Roza dhal hai. Phir wo fahsh-goi na kare aur jahalat na kare. Aur agar koi shakhs us se lade ya use gali de to use chahiye ke kahe ke main rozedar hun, do martaba. Aur Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Rozedar ke munh ki boo Allah Ta'ala ke nazdeek mushk ki khushboo se zyada umda hai. Wo mera khana, peena aur khwahish meri wajah se chhorta hai. Roza mere liye hai aur main us ka badla dunga. Aur neki dus guna hai."
"707","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ka har amal us ke liye hai, siwaye roze ke. Beshak wo mere liye hai aur main us ka badla dunga. Aur roza dhal hai. Aur jab tum mein se kisi ka roze ka din ho to wo fahsh-goi na kare aur shor na kare. Phir agar use koi gali de ya us se lade to use chahiye ke kahe ke main rozedar shakhs hun. Aur Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Rozedar ke munh ki boo Allah ke nazdeek mushk ki khushboo se zyada umda hai. Rozedar ke liye do khushiyan hain jin se wo khush hota hai: Jab iftar kare to khush hota hai, aur jab apne Rab se mile to apne roze se khush hota hai."
"708","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat mein ek darwaza hai jise Rayyan kaha jata hai. Us mein se rozedar Qayamat ke din dakhil honge. Us mein se un ke siwa koi dakhil nahi hoga. Kaha jayega: Rozedar kahan hain? Phir wo khade honge. Us mein se un ke siwa koi dakhil nahi hoga. Phir jab wo dakhil ho jayenge to band kar diya jayega aur us mein se koi dakhil nahi hoga."
"709","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Jo Allah ke raste mein ek din roza rakhe, Allah us ka chehra Aag se sattar saal door karega."
"710","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab bhool kar khaye aur piye to use chahiye ke apna roza poora kare. Kyunke use Allah ne khilaya aur pilaya hai."
"711","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) roza rakhte yahan tak ke hum kehte ke iftar nahi karenge. Aur iftar karte yahan tak ke hum kehte ke roza nahi rakhenge. Phir main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Ramazan ke siwa mahine ka poora roza rakhte nahi dekha. Aur main ne Aap ko Sha'ban mein us se zyada roza rakhte nahi dekha."
"712","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Sha'ban se zyada koi mahina roza na rakhte. Beshak Wo Sha'ban poora roza rakhte. Aur farmate: Amal mein se jitni taqat rakho karo, kyunke Allah nahi uktata yahan tak ke tum ukta jao. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko sab se mehboob namaz wo thi jis par hamesha raha jaye agarche kam ho. Aur jab Aap namaz parhte to us par hamesha rehte."
"713","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ramazan ke siwa kabhi poora mahina roza nahi rakha. Aur roza rakhte yahan tak ke kehne wala kehta: Nahi, Allah ki qasam! Iftar nahi karenge. Aur iftar karte yahan tak ke kehne wala kehta: Nahi, Allah ki qasam! Roza nahi rakhenge."
"714","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khabar di gayi ke main kehta hun: Allah ki qasam! Main din mein zaroor roza rakhunga aur raat mein zaroor qayam karunga jab tak jiunga. Phir main ne Aap se kaha: Main ne ye kaha hai, mere maan-baap Aap par fida hon. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tum is ki taqat nahi rakhte. Phir roza rakho aur iftar karo, qayam karo aur so jao. Aur mahine mein teen din roza rakho. Kyunke neki dus guna hai. Aur ye poore zamane ke roze jaisa hai. Main ne arz kiya: Beshak main is se afzal ki taqat rakhta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Phir ek din roza rakho aur do din iftar karo. Main ne arz kiya: Beshak main is se afzal ki taqat rakhta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Phir ek din roza rakho aur ek din iftar karo. Phir ye Dawud (alaihissalam) ka roza hai, jo afzal roza hai. Phir main ne arz kiya: Beshak main is se afzal ki taqat rakhta hun. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Is se afzal koi nahi."
"715","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Abdullah! Kya mujhe khabar nahi di gayi ke tum din mein roza rakhte ho aur raat mein qayam karte ho? To main ne arz kiya: Kyun nahi Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Aisa na karo. Roza rakho aur iftar karo, qayam karo aur so jao. Kyunke tumhare jism ka tum par haq hai, tumhari aankh ka tum par haq hai, tumhari biwi ka tum par haq hai, tumhare mehmaan ka tum par haq hai. Aur beshak tumhe kafi hai ke tum har mahine teen din roza rakho. Kyunke tumhare liye har neki ke das guna hain. Phir ye poore zamane ka roza hai. Phir main ne sakhti ki to mujh par sakhti ki gayi. Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main taqat pata hun. Aap ne farmaya: Phir Nabiullah Dawud (alaihissalam) ka roza rakho aur us par izafa na karo. Main ne arz kiya: Nabiullah Dawud (alaihissalam) ka roza kya tha? Aap ne farmaya: Aadhe zamane ka. Phir Abdullah budhape ke baad kehte they: Kash main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki rukhsat qubool kar leta."
"716","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mahine mein Quran parho. Main ne arz kiya: Beshak main taqat pata hun. Yahan tak ke Aap ne farmaya: Phir use saat mein parho aur is par izafa na karo."
"717","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Abdullah! Falan jaisa na bano, jo raat mein qayam karta tha phir raat ka qayam chhor diya."
"718","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khabar pahunchi ke main musalsal roza rakhta hun aur raat mein namaz parhta hun. Phir ya Aap ne meri taraf bheja ya main Aap se mila. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya mujhe khabar nahi di gayi ke tum roza rakhte ho aur iftar nahi karte, namaz parhte ho? Phir roza rakho aur iftar karo, qayam karo aur so jao. Kyunke tumhari aankh ka tum par hissa hai, tumhari jaan aur ghar walon ka tum par hissa hai. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak main is ki taqat rakhta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Phir Dawud (alaihissalam) ka roza rakho. Unhon ne kaha: Aur kaise? Aap ne farmaya: Wo ek din roza rakhte aur ek din iftar karte, aur jab milte to peeth na pherte. Unhon ne kaha: Mujhe is se kaun milayega, ae Nabiullah? Ata ne kaha [ek rawi]: Main nahi janta unhon ne hamesha ke roze ka kaise zikr kiya. Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo hamesha roza rakhe us ne roza nahi rakha, do martaba."
"719","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Beshak tum zamana roza rakhte ho aur raat mein qayam karte ho. To main ne arz kiya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak jab tum aisa karoge to aankh dhans jayegi aur jaan sust ho jayegi. Jo zamana roza rakhe us ne roza nahi rakha. Teen din ka roza poore zamane ka roza hai. Main ne arz kiya: Beshak main is se zyada ki taqat rakhta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Phir Dawud (alaihissalam) ka roza rakho. Wo ek din roza rakhte aur ek din iftar karte, aur jab milte to peeth na pherte."
"720","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Allah ko sab se mehboob namaz Dawud (alaihissalam) ki namaz hai, aur Allah ko sab se mehboob roza Dawud ka roza hai. Aur Wo aadhi raat sote, tihayi qayam karte aur chhatayi sote. Aur ek din roza rakhte aur ek din iftar karte."
"721","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko mere roze ka zikr kiya gaya. Phir Aap mere paas dakhil hue. Phir main ne Aap ke liye chamde ka takiya dala jis ka bharav chhaal thi. Phir Aap zameen par baithe aur takiya mere aur Aap ke darmiyan ho gaya. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumhe har mahine mein se teen din kafi nahi? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Paanch. Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Saat. Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Nau. Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Gyarah. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Dawud (alaihissalam) ke roze se upar koi roza nahi, aadhe zamane ka. Ek din roza rakho aur ek din iftar karo."
"722","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Aap ne un se poochha, ya ek shakhs se poochha jabke Imran sun rahe they. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae falan ke baap! Kya tum ne is mahine ke aakhir mein roza nahi rakha? Unhon ne kaha: Mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: Matlab Ramazan. Us shakhs ne arz kiya: Nahi Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Phir jab tum iftar karo to do din roza rakho."
"723","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sathiyon mein se chand mardon ko khwab mein Lailat al-Qadr aakhri saat mein dikhayi gayi. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main dekhta hun ke tumhare khwab aakhri saat mein muwafiq ho gaye hain. Phir jo use talash karne wala ho use chahiye ke use aakhri saat mein talash kare."
"724","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Ramazan ke darmiyani ashre mein i'tikaf kiya. Phir Aap bees ki subah nikle aur hamein khutba diya. Aur farmaya: Beshak mujhe Lailat al-Qadr dikhayi gayi phir mujhe bhula di gayi, ya bhulaya gaya. Phir use aakhri ashre mein taaq mein talash karo. Aur beshak main ne dekha ke main pani aur keechad mein sajda kar raha hun. Phir jo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath i'tikaf mein tha use chahiye ke laute. Phir hum laute jabke hum aasman mein badal ka tukda na dekhte they. Phir badal aaya aur barsa yahan tak ke masjid ki chhat behne lagi, jo khajoor ki tehniyon se thi. Aur namaz khadi ki gayi. Phir main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko pani aur keechad mein sajda karte dekha, yahan tak ke main ne Aap ki peshani mein keechad ka nishan dekha."
"725","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Ramazan mein mahine ke darmiyani ashre mein khalwat karte. Phir jab bees raatein guzarne par shaam hoti aur ikkiswin ka istiqbal hota to Aap apne maskan ki taraf laut-te, aur jo Aap ke sath khalwat mein tha wo lauta. Aur Aap ne us mahine qayam kiya jis mein Aap ne us raat khalwat ki jis mein Aap laut-te they. Phir logon ko khutba diya aur unhe jo Allah ne chaha hukm farmaya. Phir farmaya: Main is ashre mein khalwat karta tha. Phir mujhe zahir hua hai ke main is aakhri ashre mein khalwat karun. Phir jo mere sath i'tikaf mein tha use chahiye ke apne i'tikaf mein thehre. Aur beshak mujhe ye raat dikhayi gayi phir mujhe bhula di gayi. Phir use aakhri ashre mein talash karo, aur use har taaq mein talash karo. Aur beshak main ne apne aap ko dekha ke main pani aur keechad mein sajda kar raha hun. Phir us raat aasman khula aur barsa. Phir ikkiswin raat Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki namaz ki jagah mein masjid tapakne lagi. Phir meri aankh ne dekha, main ne Aap ki taraf dekha jab Aap Fajr se phire jabke Aap ka chehra keechad aur pani se bhara tha."
"726","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Ramazan ke aakhri ashre mein khalwat farmate. Aur farmate: Lailat al-Qadr ko Ramazan ke aakhri ashre mein talash karo."
